config HMA_UIDFAKE_BUILTIN
	bool "HMA UID visibility policy (built-in)"
	depends on NET
	select CRC32
	help
	  Compile the HMA UID policy engine and privileged generic-netlink
	  interface into the kernel. Android rule parsing runs in the companion
	  sync-tool; no loadable kernel module or runtime text patcher is used.
	  Native source hooks cover both native and compat syscall paths.
